# Checked false positives for scripts/check-privacy.cjs (see CLAUDE.md "Privacy rules").
#
# Format: <detector|*> <path-glob> [<literal>]
#   A finding is allowed when its detector and path match and, if a literal is given, the matched text contains it.
#   Globs: * (within a folder), ** (any depth), ?. Keep entries as narrow as possible and justify each one above it.
#   Pattern detectors do not scan this file itself; the local denylist does, and can never be allowlisted here.
#   Never add one of your own identifiers: remove it from the content instead.

